    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420060/extras/13337193af436897aea9351a55236354.avif?t=1742327620\" data-has-big width=800 height=136 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Extremely Fun!\u00a0\ud83d\udd25</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extremely Fun</strong> is a <strong>fast-paced action roguelike</strong> where you battle <strong>endless waves of enemies</strong>, unlock powerful upgrades, and create devastating combos. Survive, evolve, and dominate the chaos in this adrenaline-fueled experience! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2705 Features:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-Stop Action</strong> \u2013 Face relentless hordes of enemies in intense, fast-paced battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade &amp; Evolve</strong> \u2013 Unlock a variety of powerful skills and game-changing upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Yet Deep</strong> \u2013 Easy to pick up, but every run offers new challenges and strategic choices.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability</strong> \u2013 No two runs are the same. Experiment with different builds and playstyles!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist and play now to join the chaos! \ud83d\ude80</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420060/extras/13337193af436897aea9351a55236354.avif?t=1742327620\" data-has-big width=800 height=136 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Extremely Fun!\u00a0\ud83d\udd25</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extremely Fun</strong> is a <strong>fast-paced action roguelike</strong> where you battle <strong>endless waves of enemies</strong>, unlock powerful upgrades, and create devastating combos. Survive, evolve, and dominate the chaos in this adrenaline-fueled experience! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2705 Features:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-Stop Action</strong> \u2013 Face relentless hordes of enemies in intense, fast-paced battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade &amp; Evolve</strong> \u2013 Unlock a variety of powerful skills and game-changing upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Yet Deep</strong> \u2013 Easy to pick up, but every run offers new challenges and strategic choices.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability</strong> \u2013 No two runs are the same. Experiment with different builds and playstyles!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist and play now to join the chaos! \ud83d\ude80</strong></p>",
